---
import LegalPageLayout from '../../layouts/LegalPageLayout.astro';
import { dataRequestPath } from '../../i18n/paths';
---

<LegalPageLayout
  title="Privacy policy"
  description="FaktumAI website privacy policy."
  path="/en/privacy/"
>
  <p><strong>Last updated: 2026-09-14 · version 2026-09-14-v4</strong></p>

  <h2>Controller</h2>
  <p>
     <strong>Marko Virta / FaktumAI</strong><br />
      Email: <a href="mailto:marko@Faktum-AI.com">marko@Faktum-AI.com</a><br />
     Website: <a href="https://www.faktum-ai.com">www.faktum-ai.com</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Purposes</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Delivering the website, technical maintenance and security</li>
    <li>Replying to inquiries and related customer communication</li>
    <li>Fulfilling data subject rights</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Website usage</h2>
  <p>
    FaktumAI does not use user accounts, a newsletter, or an analytics service. The site's visitor
    counter stores only a global page-view count in Cloudflare KV. FaktumAI does not store IP
    addresses, user identifiers, or cookies in connection with the visitor counter.
  </p>
  <p>
    Cloudflare operates the site's hosting and CDN and may process technical request data in order
    to deliver the service and protect it.
  </p>

  <h2>Enquiries</h2>
  <p>
    When you contact us by email, we process the information you provide in order to reply and to
    manage any potential customer relationship. Data is retained only for as long as necessary to
    handle the matter or as required by applicable obligations.
  </p>

  <h2>Former newsletter</h2>
  <p>
    The FaktumAI newsletter has been discontinued. No new subscriptions or subscriber profiles are collected. Any data previously collected for the subscriber registry is
    processed only for legacy data management, deletion, and the exercise of data subject rights
    during the transition period.
  </p>
  <p>
    Technical functions related to legacy subscriber management may be retained during the
    transition period, but they are not used to collect new subscriptions or to send the newsletter.
  </p>

  <p>Legacy management and data requests process email addresses and verification tokens. Data requests also create an audit log in D1 containing a hashed IP address and a truncated browser user-agent string.</p>

  <h2>Legal bases</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Website technical operation and security: legitimate interest (GDPR 6(1)(f))</li>
    <li>Enquiries: steps prior to entering into a contract or legitimate interest (GDPR 6(1)(b)/(f))</li>
    <li>Fulfilling data subject rights: legal obligation (GDPR 6(1)(c))</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Service providers</h2>
  <p>
    Cloudflare, Inc. — hosting, CDN, Workers KV, Pages Functions and the D1 database for legacy subscriber data
  </p>
  <p>
    Google Fonts — the site loads fonts from Google's service, so the user's browser connects to Google
  </p>
  <p>
    Resend, Inc. — may be used during the transition period only to send legacy subscriber management and data-request messages
  </p>

  <h2>Data subject rights</h2>
  <p>
    You have the right, under the applicable data protection legislation, to access, rectify,
    erase, or port your personal data, and to exercise your other data subject rights.
  </p>
  <p>
    Data requests: <a href={dataRequestPath('en')}>your data page</a>
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Privacy enquiries: <a href="mailto:marko@faktum-ai.com">marko@faktum-ai.com</a>
  </p>
</LegalPageLayout>
